# Environment Variables Template (.env.example)
# Copy to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env itself.
#
# Database (local dev defaults):
# SENA_DATABASE_URL: PostgreSQL async connection string
# Default: postgresql+asyncpg://sena_app:localdev@localhost:5432/sena_ai
#
# Environment (development | staging | production):
# SENA_ENVIRONMENT: Deployment environment
# Default: development
#
# Logging:
# SENA_LOG_LEVEL: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR, CRITICAL
# SENA_LOG_FORMAT: json or text
#
# Service metadata:
# SENA_SERVICE_NAME: Service identifier
# SENA_SERVICE_VERSION: Semantic version
#
# BLOCKED - waiting for cloud provider decision:
# - Cloud provider selection (GCP/AWS/Azure)
# - LLM API keys and endpoints
# - Embedding model configuration
# - OCR engine endpoints
# - Object storage configuration
#
# These are populated after TECHNICAL_DECISIONS.md is finalized.
